EN:
Are you having fun playing with all
the tricksters on {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}April Fools' Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Today,{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}I'll make myself look like
various people in town{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} and pay
them all a {{TAG:0003:0026:}}surprise visit!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Eh?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Think I was lying just now?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Hee hee! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}If that's what you think,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
come and watch the fun in a bit!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Let's see {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}whose house I should pick
for my first trick of the day{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} And remember,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}when the ticket
gates are open or you have a visitor,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
the surprise has to be postponed!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Then{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}let's get this going!

ES:
¿Estás disfrutando de todas las
bromas pesadas que se están
gastando en el {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Día de las Bromas{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Hoy voy a hacer mi número estrella:
¡{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}me haré pasar por algún vecino{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}y le haré una visita sorpresa!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡¿Cómo?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} ¿Que hablo de boquilla?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Je, je, je. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Si de verdad piensas eso,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
sígueme y compruébalo tú mism{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
¡Te aseguro que lo vas a pasar
en grande!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Veamos quién será mi primera
víctima del día{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Si la puerta de acceso de
la estación está abierta o tienes
visita,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¡toca posponer la travesura!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Dicho esto,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡pongámonos en
marcha!

IT:
Ti stai divertendo{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} con tutti
i bugiardi che circolano in
occasione del pesce d'aprile?
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Oggi{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}prenderò le sembianze
di qualcuno di questa città{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
e farò a tutti{{TAG:0003:0026:}} una bella sorpresa!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cosa?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Pensi che stia mentendo?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ih ih ih, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}se la pensi davvero così,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
allora vedrai con i tuoi occhi!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Allooora {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}a casa di chi potrei andare{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
per fare la mia sorpresina{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}Ricorda,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}quando ci sono
i cancelli aperti{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} o c'è qualcuno
in visita,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} non si può fare!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
E ora, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}siii cooominciaaa!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1 Nisan{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'da bütün şakacılarla
eğleniyor musun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Bugün{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}kasabadaki
farklı kişilerin kılığına
gireceğim{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ve hepsine {{TAG:0003:0026:}}sürpriz
ziyarette bulunacağım!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ne?!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Az
önce yalan söylediğimi mi
sandın?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Hihihi! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Öyle düşünüyorsan{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
birazdan eğlenceyi görmeye gel!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Bakalım{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}} günün ilk şakası için
kimin evini seçsem{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Unutma,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}bilet kapıları açıkken ya da
misafirin varken{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sürprizi
ertelemem gerekiyor!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
O zaman{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}başlayalım!

FR:
Alors là, je suis surprise ! C'est
l'arroseur arrosé, comme on dit !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
Et les chats, ça aime pas l'eau{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Mais bravo !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu m'as démasquée à
chaque fois, et c'était pas gagné !
T'es super balèze, je le reconnais.

IT:
Pensavo di fartela e invece
alla fine{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} mi hai trovata{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}}
ogni volta{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} senza sbagliare{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Accipicchia!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Il mio scherzo ha finito
per ritorcersi contro di me!

DE:
Ich wollte dich überraschen,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} aber du{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
hast mich jedes einzelne Mal vorher
gefunden...
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Wie hast du das gemacht?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000E:}}Ich hab mir solche Mühe gegeben
und du durchschaust mich einfach!
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Hast du geschummelt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bestimmt!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kann gar nicht anders sein!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Tut mir leid.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ich muss wohl einfach
zugeben, {{TAG:0003:0020:}}dass in Wirklichkeit du
{{TAG:000E:0006:160064006500720020004D006500690073007400650072001A0064006900650020004D0065006900730074006500720069006E00}} der Verkleidung bist!

IT:
Il mio travestimento ha funzionato!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}La gente in città sembrava contenta
della mia piccola sorpresa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}che bello!

DE:
Gute Verkleidung, oder nicht?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Den Leuten hat meine kleine
Überraschung anscheinend gefallen.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Das freut mich riesig!

EN:
I should polish my skills more{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
so everyone will enjoy my fun
prank again next year too!

IT:
Devo perfezionare le mie capacità,{{TAG:0003:0021:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
così l'anno prossimo potrò fare
divertire tutti ancora di più!

DE:
Ich sollte meine Verkleidungskünste
noch etwas polieren, damit's auch
nächstes Jahr wieder lustig wird!{{TAG:0003:0021:}}

TRANSLATION:
Gelecek yıl da herkes eğlenceli
şakamın tadını çıkarsın diye{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
yeteneklerimi biraz daha geliştirmeliyim!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Accipicchia,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} hai proprio fiuto
