capacità di trasformista e invece{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}That was pretty entertaining, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Though I'm a little bummed you saw
