{{TAG:0003:0015:}}artık oyunu bırakmalıyım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gelecek
yıl insanlara yeni bir şaka
yapmak için döneceğim{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}; sonraki {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1
Nisan{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'da görüşürüz!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Du hast mich durchschaut!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Tja...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich will zwar noch nicht
aufhören,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} aber langsam wird's Zeit.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nächstes Jahr komme ich wieder,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
also sei bereit!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Gözün bayağı iyi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Peki,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}istemiyorum ama{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} artık oyunu
